jors who were  mumbling and grumbling and bitching and  moaning just like i was they knew the  truth the book about face the odyssey of  an american warrior colonel david h  hackworth u.s army retired and julie  sherman thank you very much for your  time my pleasure  david hackworth is a syndicated  columnist for king features his other  works include vietnam primer which was  published by the pentagon and used as a  training manual during the vietnam war  his book pictured here about face the  odyssey of an american warrior is  currently available in paperback from  simon schuster trade  every weekend book tv brings you an  encore presentation of c-span's book  notes program  encore book notes airs saturdays at 7  p.m and sundays at 11 a.m eastern here  on c-span 2.  next week historian michael beschloss  has booked the crisis years examines the  relationship between president kennedy  and soviet leader nikita khrushchev and  its impact on the cold war
 

